              "value": "Read the following output and extract it into the JSON format as shown: \n{\n\"sourceLocationGid\": \"<domainName>.<locationXid>\" | \"MISSING\" if not found,\n\"needsReview\": true | false\n}\n\nIf sourceLocationGid is greater than 1 gid or is missing, then set needsReview to true. Otherwise, set it to false.\n\nExample 1:\n{\n \"sourceLocationGid\": \"DOMAIN.LOCATIONXID\",\n \"needsReview\": false\n}\nExample 2:\n{\n\"sourceLocationGid\": \"DOMAIN.LOCATIONXID1, DOMAIN.LOCATIONXID2\",\n\"needsReview\": true\n}\n\nOutput: {{$context.$nodes.GET_SOURCE_LOCATION_BY_NAME.$output}}"
